      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "EverAnimate Embeds → WanVideo Sampler (jc) → WanVideo Decode (jc)\n\nEmbeds: 77 frames/chunk, num_chunks controls length.\n2 chunks = 150 frames; 10 chunks = 734 frames.\nSampler: Euler / 20 steps / CFG 1 / shift 5. Set the seed here.\nThe sampler generates all chunks and joins them automatically.\nUse the first samples output → Decode → Video Combine.\nSet VAE tiling on Embeds for the whole generation.\nWan2.2-Animate-14B + EverAnimate stage2_480p LoRA at strength 1.\nChoose the reference image and driving video inputs before running."
      ]
    },
